{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":293079,"ns":0,"title":"Actuator","extract":"An actuator is a component of a machine that produces force, torque, or displacement, when an electrical, pneumatic or hydraulic input is supplied to it in a system (called an actuating system). The effect is usually produced in a controlled way.","description":"Machine component that moves a mechanism","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}